NOTICE -- what is in this repository and what terms it carries

This repository is the COHERENT 3-series kernel for the Commodore 900
(Z8001): os/sys (the 2.3.37-derived portable kernel plus the Z8001 machine
layer), os/hrtty (the hi-res console driver), the kernel-class headers under
os/include, os/tests/{rawalign,loadavg,deepstack}, and the host build
scripts that link, drive and package them (os/hostbuild, mk/). It was split
out of commodore-900-coherent by TASK-288, with full git history carried by
git-filter-repo; commodore-900-coherent's own NOTICE.md is the complete
inventory for the repository this one was cut from, and is the fuller
account if a question here is not answered below.

