2. Two files with a second party's notice

MWC shipped other people's code inside its own trees, and the qualification
in section 1 is not a formality: two names in this repository's source are
not Mark Williams's, and neither carries a grant of its own (copyright is
asserted; no permission statement is given).

  - INETCO Systems Ltd., 1984-1989 -- os/sys/z8001/h/fdioctl.h and
    os/include/sys/fdioctl.h.
  - Todd Fleming, 1991-1992 -- os/sys/ref/io.286/{kb_vt.c,mm_vt.c,mmas_vt.m},
    virtual-terminal additions kept in os/sys/ref for comparison and never
