3. What is new work for the Commodore 900

Written for this port, or for the 3.5 forward-port; no upstream carries a
Commodore 900 target for 3.5:

  - os/hrtty -- the hi-res console driver, moved out of the 0.7.3 kernel and
    reworked as a loadable driver.
  - os/sys/drv/, and the os/sys/z8001/ port edits -- Z8001 drivers and
    machine-layer work on top of the MWC base. As with section 1, an edit to
    an existing Mark Williams file does not change whose code the file is;
    this line names work that is genuinely this project's own.
  - os/hostbuild/{link-kernel.sh,build-drivers.sh,build-hostfs.sh,
    check-stamps.sh,kheaders.py,pack-kernel.sh,provenance.sh,toolchain.sh,
    toolchain.mk,kboot.mk,kboot.sh,wdbtab-hd21.h}, os/tests/, mk/, and the
    root Makefile -- the host build this repository runs.

